  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Wash away your worries with pure clean water using the iBlue Link Filter System</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">10% Affiliate Commission</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(132, 63, 161);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">20% Coupon Code for your Audience&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">(Upon activation, please customize the coupon code to better fit your channel/content)</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161); font-size: 14pt;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">&bull; Product description:</span> </strong>Portable High-Performance Shower Filter</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- <strong>Portable </strong>: </span>travel friendly, comes with a travel case, worry free vacation with pure clean shower water in every destination&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-<strong> Hot Water filter</strong> :</span> Made with heat resistant material so you can enjoy both hot and cold showers without a worry&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- <strong>Compatible</strong>: </span>with most handheld, fixed, and rainfall shower heads&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- <strong>Quick and Easy</strong></span> installation under 3-minutes tool-free</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;- <strong>Filteration </strong>:</span> antiviral and antibacterial filtration that catches residue down to 1 micrometer small, filtering out rust, metal, deposits, mold spores, microplastics, chemicals, bacteria, and even viruses</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">10% Commission on all purchases made through affiliate link.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Payout on the last day of the month. (This may change upon automated payout integration)</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">If you need the product for content creation, please contact us at iblue@purewaterlink.com .</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"><strong>&bull; Other information regarding the product:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><b>Other Shower Filters:</b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Other shower filters can only catch particles as small as 5 micrometers small. However, with the new Omnia filters developed in South Korea, the iBlue Pure Water Link Filter can catch particles as small as 1 micrometer.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Other shower filters mostly use carbon filter and are not recommended for hot water as the carbon filters lose material integrity in hot temperatures causing outflow of contaminants it was holding. We do not use carbon filters.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.3333px;\">Other shower filters are bulky and not recommended for travel. Our filters have a patented pleated design for 12 times more surface for filtration of the same size. This makes room to engineer a smaller size filter but still sustains the filtration capacity needed for household showers. Needing filter change after 1 to 3 months of use.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Cause of contaminants and impurities on skin and hair:</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Microplastics &ndash; causes&nbsp;tiny abrasions in your skin. Washing with water filled with microplastics damages your skin and clumps up between hair follicles.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Chlorine and Chloramines &ndash; chemically dehydrates skin and hair causing cracks in skin and brittle hair.&nbsp;These chemicals remove natural oils that keep your skin and hair healthy.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Mold, viruses, rust, metals, and other impurities &ndash; can build up in pores and enter your deep skin leading to irritation, rashes, eczema.</span></p>",
